<title>GABON: SOCCER-MBILINGA BEAT MOTEMA IN AFRICAN CHAMPIONS' CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MBILINGA BEAT MOTEMA IN AFRICAN CHAMPIONS' CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LIBREVILLE 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mbilinga FC of Gabon beat Zaire's Daring Club Motema Pembe 3-0 (halftime 2-0) in an African Champions League first round first leg tie played on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Yves Nzaboutamba 3, Theodore Zue Nguema 57, Didier Abada 86</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
